+    Description:
+        Function to compare two codon nucleotide sequences (size 3) and retuns the position where it differs.
+    Input:
+        seq1 - string size 3 [A,T,C,G]. Ex. "ATC"
+        seq2 - string size 3 [A,T,C,G]. Ex. "ACC"
+    Returns:
+        Returns position where seq1 != seq2
+    """
+    if seq1 == "NA":
